menu "ToneRelay"

    config TONERELAY_BLE_MIDI
        bool "BLE MIDI input"
        default n
        depends on BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED
        help
            Advertise a Bluetooth LE MIDI service, so a phone, tablet or DAW can send MIDI to the box (the way a WIDI Jack receives it).
            The box forwards it to the pedal's USB MIDI interface. See docs/ble-midi.md. Enable it with sdkconfig.midi.defaults.

    config TONERELAY_BLE_MIDI_ENCRYPT
        bool "Require an encrypted link for BLE MIDI"
        default y
        depends on TONERELAY_BLE_MIDI
        help
            The phone pairs ("Just Works") the first time it talks to the box and the pairing is kept. Turn this off only to test:
            anyone in range can then send MIDI to the box without pairing.

endmenu
